{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7d9aabc45b06754084efdfce09f2e175714e72a7fb74922a162bbc24aee0b64f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:406ecc34db1f17de3b5112d67246f0ecac5c3a2955b7e347d46bd5b4cac126da",
      "text": "错位的思绪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e5238656be41edfc77c19a3b12cdc0f522ea383d41dd29a150a2c4aecdf4b5b",
      "text": "与受伤的悠介分开，享介独自迎战比赛。\n虽然他不断告诫自己悠介一定会回来，\n但却接连失误导致被换下场。\n在电视上看到享介这副模样的悠介，\n突然产生了一个念头。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:406ecc34db1f17de3b5112d67246f0ecac5c3a2955b7e347d46bd5b4cac126da",
      "text": "错位的思绪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cf6732ecb7f3ccada61363ed67237462959d3561a81635b3d16ccdfab41cfea",
      "text": "（今天的对手是连胜中势头正劲的队伍。\n必须打起精神严阵以待才行）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:336f23f904db6fe192e79c80bd470c54a90db33609f33e4529e95d5c708c5d68",
      "text": "……唉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f79b1135a89d54f5e83d031b637a13bc747419fd18754fcb065cb74ac31dfc6",
      "text": "（平时都是和悠介一边开战术会议，\n一边走向球场的呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a218ddd3aa65c1d4587fe4ca75a4fad360fff7ca92b6f05fbf7bbbd8a62169b",
      "text": "我不在的这段时间，球队的事就\n全拜托你了！放心吧，享介绝对没问题的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3c668a3a8dd27ff92be44863d1b9185a526792cff3bf20a3b8626576ce746c6",
      "text": "我马上就会复出的，包在我身上！\n我们可是最强双胞胎啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21a2286912d0b098fae2b88b846452628047703cd616d95a1b923cc1cb6177f6",
      "text": "（……没事的。悠介绝对会回来的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:567cb556671ae07a974059ce19c0a608658e5f9cc9bb47c7d9be7c287f8d197f",
      "text": "（为了这个目标，\n他现在正在努力做康复训练）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2f8b06ddb76fa322aceb645f19d740700c5b1433ab86a3adb2b5127d3841a1f",
      "text": "为了悠介归来的时候着想，我也必须\n稳稳拿下胜利，提升球队的士气才行……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:641c1cd5629530d7736d2ea8459cdf6cc4d5067a31ba97cad4ff1aaeb9b03fe2",
      "text": "（……可是，那会是什么时候？\n前阵子医生明明说暂时不要回球场）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63b0c35fb1cd222aec2b1885957dfd214a694f9375ac26bc0a7e7a90cfb2fe75",
      "text": "（……不行，比赛前不能胡思乱想。\n……但是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bf57c01d39f73d63fd43e39e72008b6c7bdbac6dec731a2109de94cb7bdd6ce",
      "text": "呼，已经这个时间了啊……\n糟了，比赛已经开始了！电视，电视！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84d832a4e5ab2599b429888880ce7bd5f52f36d8c7b51f45ef63a9e972351a2f",
      "text": "啊，被压制了啊。情况看起来很不妙呢。\n……嗯？享介呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73b86a517cbb377bde3e1f9e18f446d03a321bcb3f3bb14158872ae0ad801a37",
      "text": "好的，苍井享介选手退回了替补席。\n球队能从这里展开反击吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4e853c04696aa6c65323b5ec0e3fbeff8c412474c639a9432fd98a06caef8a2",
      "text": "享介被换下了！？为什么！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9205dabb084bd9df5b7800f6434bb96d23f16c66c3294673d9ade0c87ce28092",
      "text": "那么，请看比赛的精彩集锦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:649ebedcfdb31efa99a5bdec3c23db10ca8fc656ef539edd93df39f581639a61",
      "text": "对方球队的中场，是个擅长盘带的选手。\n但要是享介的话应该能断下来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a077b31f14c5b0db0121f47bd2410f44940080d5c5d4dfe2015151e4a952ec79",
      "text": "……骗人的吧，被过掉了！\n享介竟然会犯这种低级失误。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e71dcf69178533f9dd8f7010e6bdc901bfb81535cce5abcc3c19f7d20c0bfa5",
      "text": "要是我在的话，绝对不会犯那种失误的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a88f5d9fee7b68123bf9c430af17316a7651e5b7a7c5126e12a4d3ea732759c9",
      "text": "（而且换做平时的享介，\n绝对不会那么轻易被断球的！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_c:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffa897c9864af0b2d70e6a2b0b0c7dbfba3e60c86c9802bdf7a6d03d9b9fabd0",
      "text": "在此之后苍井享介选手也没能找回状态，\n接连出现失误，最终被替换下场。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cf3985eb1759688095725dd477d5557af2c1a2cd47871609b652e433cf3b412",
      "text": "享介状态不好的原因……是我吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abe3bf4d262881738d73c7aaf3d771b987da3846683f4bac83e2d92ccdd4a907",
      "text": "康复训练进行得很顺利。\n只不过，即便伤势彻底痊愈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35d268e8669705034ba33a9d2967d871fd60e5ef84129aec3a90ed1972103531",
      "text": "暂时也不建议进行剧烈运动。像以前那样\n作为足球运动员满场飞奔，近期最好还是避免……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45d3041c9778460ca47ec4fee4170650fb378e30789f0e6ec3c98386ed6199bc",
      "text": "“暂时”大概是多久？\n现在对我们来说是非常重要的时期！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:feb171242aaaca0520832405f9da2733699b2f120b9e6ffb939da222ec5a27d7",
      "text": "……享介这家伙，前阵子一起去听诊断结果的时候，\n问医生的问题比我还多呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_c:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:639b6902fa3a40ef8a0aeb49fce38c8b8edd713f7165f971824d4cbd274289dc",
      "text": "（不管我怎么说“我没事所以别担心”，\n也根本起不到任何作用）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_c:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:932ef9e3129ec737d8c36af718d1d487730035221009d1e3d2e4bb58017f4006",
      "text": "……好的，比分依然在变动！\n机会来了！能否实现逆转呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_c:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2980daadad8a4e4167c9a900ff514cd207060d8a5df7e08a0d6ceef424181b18",
      "text": "（享介……以你的实力，\n就算一个人也完全可以大放异彩的啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e050cbe39053b8e06d7d2a904df020e2e77d8cc142c3c8627e36aea371bb8b73",
      "text": "悠介，情况怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:423c002fa4b57943adc702cbcf557e0b2cfbc9dfba8eaa445d3a98b8507196aa",
      "text": "比之前好很多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe9d35ab260e52b2f634a5a8a7da290463e1ca0d8466db49a5da6b813de62ffe",
      "text": "已经定在下周末出院了……\n不过医生还是嘱咐要继续做康复训练。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05207774fd3cb96e302805159073ecac7731d9c8c2e8f3b043c48e8fcc4dc935",
      "text": "要想恢复到以前那样的踢法，\n可能还需要一点时间。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95f79384359629439dabb2d8788e63f9f9f83b2a061589d6388aac500920bd97",
      "text": "这样啊……关于享介的事，你大概也注意到了吧。\n因为你的伤，他陷入了低迷。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfde17b6fbd64211d065e1c59362d2a8667d209f2778c75713af5cc400baeda2",
      "text": "啊，哈哈……是的。\n前几天的比赛我看了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d877261e79fc2b8222ce07d6598b7db645a57f9f47163b6ba5675cd7b17b0328",
      "text": "……如果有“哪怕一个人也要踢下去”的决心，\n应该能稍微跑动起来的。看来还是相当困难啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b90e3518b2826bbdd9eb20d07cb7f9c4ec681909fe31cc5844131e508ba80293",
      "text": "既然你要出院了，配合你的步调，\n我也打算让享介先离开比赛名单好好休息一阵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89818ae7d26b550472e9de979c6fb9dc31c270a34d29d76800eed96f0581a6ed",
      "text": "在这段时间里，你们两个人好好聊聊以后的事吧。\n享介那边由我去说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d25c8e1cd716014522d53a634541c3fe7c8644c93b302bcaff7d15bcdb85a2a8",
      "text": "明白了。\n麻烦您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_e:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:383317aa8ab0423f5a3f43c4564750aaac9491a4821159a70afb6cd2699482bc",
      "text": "……那家伙果然也和我一样，\n希望能两个人一起踢吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_e:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c7ea510af26ad5a65dd8b97d5c3855feff3d0bcb403e0dd2f8ac5914551af19",
      "text": "（可是以我现在的腿，想要恢复到以前那样踢球，\n到底还需要多久啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce2d40fd0635c33537da7393722493df58a522ea9777dc48171cbd93b06d8274",
      "text": "……两个人一起，吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e3b659e85902fb435bf7b2f054c44d4895f838d164a4a00793bfb851e7f9871",
      "text": "那样的话，就算不是足球\n也可以吗，享介？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:332947fe4c29158702215a85e74942f37ef00d984b421a77613daa558d858f1d",
      "text": "我在一家名叫315 Production的事务所，\n担任偶像制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73a60df33cc99f44bf3f7ccc6cb326ed24791bdf4256c78c6532285e0aeaa7a3",
      "text": "我在两位身上感受到了成为偶像的天赋。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de81fbdfb80836e2493276290a5d2bab3ac5b17b65912bb338a21f61f2356d44",
      "text": "虽然以前从没考虑过当偶像。\n……但如果是两个人一起的话，感觉会很有趣啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acd8fd3f0faef4e6766e04c987b8836eb2620a93feae8571ae2c245147a1470d",
      "text": "哎呀，我又一个人自顾自地想了一大堆！\n必须好好找享介商量才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_e:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3708056717824182584039ca894f5e6bccf8978cf2a062ca1f4158c49fc4406",
      "text": "（说不定这也正好能成为享介下定决心\n“哪怕一个人也要踢足球！”的契机呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_e:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7afa17050b1a17c97310015021bf71273af809fddc29b19c34a972bfe93f1da",
      "text": "……喂，享介？\n那个啊，你现在能来一趟医院吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b0714cc7022c3199ffb4b7084495d5b9d3ef6ea0cfe3d97ee14ca019e3e78a6",
      "text": "（买到新出的点心了，太好了。\n因为是今天才发售的，悠介应该也还没吃过）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4eb9f276dc999f4abbe869f69bd99b6d742f9acd97ab9a033f92c4cb3805dcac",
      "text": "（被拜托买的其他东西也没问题。\n没有漏买的，好）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b0604e445f47efab3a9a88e984957880e3f1b85fb4758931eef12f82169f439",
      "text": "……啊，肌贴好像快用完了。\n得买几个练习用的备着才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e20e82197ce9805cd261418f328f885ad4da2875f1b9c985a03a4c41c0554209",
      "text": "（去医院之前，顺路去一下体育用品店吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b322bc8a760d0df71d0377e2424fec9ce196e0077383416d448d3ef5fa549c0",
      "text": "啊，是享介大哥哥——\n呐，今天能一起踢足球吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23f7536e5a1194c6641c646c6b99538c97e1cbc2d5457340323e2d25ca3ac216",
      "text": "嗯，如果悠介说可以的话就踢哦。\n不过你们居然能认出我是享介呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa3740396f63ebc66eefcc0e50a23fb23db5e1afb95835519b7fd201cd058071",
      "text": "戴着眼镜嘛，穿的衣服也不一样。\n一眼就认出来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c854a51bdb5c6b67d44c3015408c048e3426a0f117e4b90e1dbc115217d3a20",
      "text": "待会儿我们去悠介大哥哥的病房找你们哦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9662f23c56dd6342c3895a6b47030d17f0068443131bfcf7a40502b27477e306",
      "text": "哎呀，悠介君。\n不拄拐杖走路没问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ac4dd8353f0f49ae86475a4ffea4cb164785d74b07ff39740270b7eab6a499a",
      "text": "不是的，我不是悠介，是弟弟享介。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd57019eac24a829e04a9f1544e1d087d056b18d6cd1278f5c82993abd473926",
      "text": "哎呀，真是一模一样。悠介君平时经常陪我聊天的。\n我每天都盼着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b38400449785f9454fcb8f945dac6b7a3427149841fe6df139854d135c5d9578",
      "text": "（悠介无论在小孩子还是老人中间都很受欢迎啊。\n彻底融入这里了呢，真像他的作风）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_g:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b2e1bedca5d22fa35d6c04fd3d073efcb48c2b0ab51fa73c49f6eb02ff45501",
      "text": "那个，冒昧打扰一下，请问您是苍井享介先生吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_g:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56ba006751ca1432aa19b3b1017038781d2a5977d98940ea358e73036dabc194",
      "text": "诶？\n……是的，我是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76482942301f31ff6cb27d9119f5cc4f41bd5f3569b008a4e56ddc14ebbd9697",
      "text": "（这人是谁啊？看起来不像医院的人，\n难道是来打探悠介情况的记者……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_g:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8060805a18e86e6e38e67edf976689ba04d9b52aa9029382e0b7e35380f362d4",
      "text": "那个……请问我们在哪里见过吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_g:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:144c06e32ec5cb1d4d4e8c5dd6134dcc716628fe4d53456e52406902c6789c04",
      "text": "非常抱歉，没能先向您自报家门。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_g:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ffbfcf512e6ab837b32886764733fa8b251b3b8d92103856982f2edb5509507",
      "text": "我在一家名叫315 Production的偶像事务所\n担任制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_g:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16fbadcc04372bb98cd519f683b5c44326073139afd88d5052e51bd176b0dc70",
      "text": "我和悠介先生约好了这个时间聊一聊，\n所以今天特地赶过来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_g:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd39763da80c6f526e7f22ccb5f3674bde83c763b2a303ee82593554bd3c2fc8",
      "text": "（偶像事务所？为什么那种人会找悠介？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_g:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5754cf1ce6879e7968d27a1d81b91ce9bf428f2997b53521d99e7a2bbbb4ab70",
      "text": "（……真的约好了吗。\n算了，我也不能擅自把人赶走）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_g:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf5ddc3a7640445acade664f409f66b3547d2bb319fca61beba254c2345b3c52",
      "text": "那么，我们一起去悠介的病房吧。\n请走这边。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c8ba4d1d9efa3af83397908e39d926fd0932f067f3564365af1364593577402",
      "text": "哦，享介！还有……啊，对了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_h:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:018566643edb3df6829cffffbb51b1fbdddf0750d9756b019c1ef3f4c58f7268",
      "text": "有客人说想见你，我带过来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_h:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:875c1b411a861426e5b4020baa63a79f1bb70f62fedf30c2bec69806b2b978ee",
      "text": "你好，悠介先生。\n我是来继续之前的话题的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_h:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ceb26328610639f7bf64e90add9a911689253abaf366adf3412b848414489755",
      "text": "啊，是那件事对吧。不好意思。\n让我先跟享介单独说两句！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_h:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:715ee97025bd539bdafe34f9960b1772fa328cff4c22b975e70559b42246e309",
      "text": "那个啊，享介。虽然有点突然。\n我们去当偶像怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_h:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02a6f418a249143fbb49558f31b1c742f7e84f247f02677ee9c571b0309e03df",
      "text": "哈……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_h:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6804fef0dcde4fa1e81a70b676e2863050a173daaf4c0f00d6789fc79c3eb103",
      "text": "前几天你不在的时候，这个人跟我说\n“感受到了成为偶像的天赋”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_h:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73e198e4a5c05247795f353513e5db4cfe191046b2f45eeb61736ef4f1625454",
      "text": "我觉得好像挺有意思的，\n所以今天想听听享介的意见。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_h:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56d402c19caeb137b98c5a403ef9e3e0e95103c0de5dc4f1291d5040ef06c8af",
      "text": "不过，那个……抱歉！\n这种事明明应该更早跟你商量的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_h:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42ea843c133ca54fc8f3ad1f01d57ae25230b1db3f198e5e7285fb40b6199e9a",
      "text": "我把这个人这个时间要来的事给忘了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_h:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25c8c46d041218bf6ef36f422e288747405ae02da788271c17ae7d06eaf4de31",
      "text": "（……等等，你在说什么啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b5ee96f8876b22aa260077904c5f294d321ea47b97806a3df0d7ae0970e0172",
      "text": "我这边也是，来得不是时候，实在抱歉。\n请容我当面再正式向两位说明一次。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b8d43fb6a52beab38daeb3982f3c7cee813d3bee5d2ef3cf75014cb3fef7ebe",
      "text": "很久以前我就在电视和杂志上看到过闪闪发光的两位。\n前几天，当真正见到悠介先生时……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000035:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bfeaf2f6ed2908a9c20cb987e3645c7eccfb839a36bb378106ab215ec2e446d",
      "text": "（突然说什么当偶像……到底在胡言乱语什么啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a2c3b26038c419a649a7b0eebfe2312fea9d45afc2a6948c136457171003ae5",
      "text": "（你又一个人擅自做决定了吗？\n我的事情……对你来说根本怎样都无所谓吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:771057cdeffcd1458057c02cb7065839fbaa887eaf173170ddcc763d23642e2a",
      "text": "那个啊，享介。虽然顺序有点搞反了。\n但要是想到还有这样一条路，不觉得很有意思吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dde464fa5dc1568d23eeb8652d5007730c1eaa904e966a5be5410e766e340a5c",
      "text": "……每次都是这样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c",
      "text": "诶？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cab7ca2c531f19c69e7628c80f44b667ae85df41aad33c20f5e070e99ffb1112",
      "text": "悠介每次都是这样！！\n只顾着自己想做的事，完全不看周围！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af5e8b55c3eebf15cd5dc3bc0810e0a987dc0f1ffdc2f80166551d83f105191b",
      "text": "我的心情……你哪怕有一点……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f20af647107f1883a208aaca5711a303ce7f0cdd951ce88f2e884144e000766f",
      "text": "享介！！等一下……呜！可恶，脚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f91417a78e2ab62f455113c7770f9998477f8de9ed4867a17371817bd802e359",
      "text": "悠介先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_j:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a0bbafd57210c11d61d08680d1455cdd64c91645946a59a3aaa160aa9563171",
      "text": "……我到底在干什么啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_j:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1401ba9cd2fd62bf98c386f0cacf0fc810787c672dcaf1ccbc80f6aa66e0df5a",
      "text": "（突然大喊大叫的，一点都不冷静。\n可是，这一次……悠介也太自作主张了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_j:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58363413f0dcb49efc401122cd4f6476446ee62686aab7579c0840b3bdb6c3dc",
      "text": "……在我止步不前的时候，\n那家伙却一个劲地往前走……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_j:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d469666b965792b74a07b563f6931e189f828761b48f736b01984986ce212e97",
      "text": "（明明没有悠介我什么都做不到。\n那家伙却连看都不看我一眼……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_j:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d6ccf252ad3dbf71c135255c39d7bb244af39379541970623760d479de818e",
      "text": "（……不。怪悠介是不对的。\n悠介的人生是他自己的。而且……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_j:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c95dee345240844d3920375742e7122409c60586cdd6ef2222f5ca659d7f6ec0",
      "text": "（我们变成这样，全都是因为……\n全都是害得悠介受了伤的我的错啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_j:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0136fcf3b1eb5a80d308268306e829351171e1f33afcff2fbdeb725f8f85429",
      "text": "可是，我……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
